6. Your Next 2–3 Month Mission

Your goal is clear:

🎯 Practice only (labs & simulations)
🎯 Build 70–80% confidence
🎯 Think before acting
🎯 Learn both attack & defense

No rush. No shortcuts.

7. How Professionals Think (Mindset Shift)

Beginners ask:

“What tool do I run?”

Professionals ask:

“What is the goal, impact, and risk?”

Always think:

Why am I doing this?

What happens if it succeeds?

How would I defend against it?

That’s the real skill.

8. Red Flags to Avoid

If you ever feel:

Overconfident too early

Attracted to illegal shortcuts

Wanting “quick hacking fame”

🚨 Stop. Re-center. Go back to labs.

Cybersecurity rewards patience, not ego.

